WEBVTT

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:16.000
<v Lena>Quick recap: p99 checkout latency spiked to 4 seconds for 40 minutes on Tuesday.

00:01:02.000 --> 00:01:09.000
<v Omar>Root cause was the connection pool limit after the config push. We've rolled it back.

00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:43.000
<v Lena>Decision then: config pushes to payments need a second reviewer from now on.

00:01:44.000 --> 00:01:45.000
<v Omar>Agreed.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:32.000
<v Lena>Omar, can you add an alert on pool saturation?

00:02:33.000 --> 00:02:36.000
<v Omar>Yes, I'll add it by end of week.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:19.000
<v Jin>I'll write the customer-facing incident summary tomorrow.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:04.000
<v Lena>Jin, also draft the load-test plan for the pool change.

00:05:20.000 --> 00:05:26.000
<v Lena>Actually, scratch that, drop the load-test plan. Platform team is covering it instead.

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:08.000
<v Omar>Someone should probably update the runbook too.
